WEBVTT

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:03.580
"DNA Paternity Test Report"
"NswF Genetics Laboratory"

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.630
This is a DNA report we received.

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:09.920
What?

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:12.760
How can that be?

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:30.460
Just before the shot, my chest feels like it's gonna tear open

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:34.050
I shout out countless times, break out

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:39.240
It's not over, rush through the endless night

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:44.530
Hot blood flows through my body

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:48.240
The moment it ultimately rots away

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:54.840
it's all over, fragments of an empty dream come to mind

00:00:55.310 --> 00:01:00.340
I can never go back, I can't remember a thing

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:05.880
I've been reduced to struggling, and my voice won't carry

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:09.390
Uncontrollable impulses

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:16.310
Give me your XTC, let me feel it one more time

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:23.530
This body heats up, and I shout out your name in the darkness

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:30.530
Give me your XTC, I don't need false love

00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:33.710
I will accept it, sin and punishment

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:40.280
Slash through the destiny I've been set up with, Blade

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:44.480
This shows that the woman claiming
to be Rihoko-Chan's real mother

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:49.750
"Difference"

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:53.610
is unquestionably her biological parent.

00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:59.070
Me and Riko, not related? That can't be...

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:05.120
This person... let us call her "Ms. S.,"
just happened to pass by you

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:07.700
when the Great Quake struck six years ago...

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:12.580
And then they wound up separated...

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:15.800
She had never imagined she was still alive.

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:19.880
But then just recently, she happened
to catch sight of Rihoko-Chan

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:23.260
and felt absolutely certain that it was her.

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:28.640
In these cases, we don't divulge
details about either party,

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:31.150
but in any case, Child Welfare sees no problem

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:36.690
in handing Rihoko-Chan over to Ms. S.

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:38.150
You can't be serious!

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:39.610
Amaha-san.

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:42.070
I realize how this must feel,

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:44.910
after having lived as family all this time.

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:47.830
Even so, it's best for
her to live with her real

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:49.710
That's !

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:55.590
That's...

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:59.210
You know I can't agree to that!

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:00.720
Amaha-san...

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:04.550
Her "real mother"?

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:07.640
What bull.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:11.850
You're the ones who said
Rihoko and I were family!

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:14.560
So now you're just going to

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:17.860
It couldn't be helped, amid all that confusion.

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:22.860
A maternity record book and an
infant were discovered with you,

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:28.700
and besides, "Amaha Masane"
was a false name to begin with...

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:29.790
A false name?

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:32.290
It seems you had some problems.

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:36.540
And your memory loss didn't
make matters any better.

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:43.720
But I've worked so hard,
with Riko as my daughter!

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:47.550
There's no need for that hard work anymore.

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:49.310
Things are different now!

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:52.100
Riko is the most important thing to me!

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:53.850
I understand that.

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:57.150
But Rihoko-Chan is still very young.

00:03:57.230 --> 00:04:00.530
She needs the love of her real mother.

00:04:00.610 --> 00:04:01.690
Leave.

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:07.530
I've heard enough. Leave!

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:16.460
You'll need to pack, so I'll leave
Rihoko-Chan with you for today.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:17.880
Amaha-san...

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:22.550
...please consider what will
make Rihoko-Chan truly happy.

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:38.810
Rihoko-Chan, I'll be back tomorrow to get you.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:42.690
Then we can go and see your real mother!

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:47.700
Well, goodbye.

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.540
What the hell?!

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:55.540
This is just too terrible...

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:00.040
Rihoko-Chan...

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:05.050
Mom!

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:06.800
Riko!

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:07.880
Mom!

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:13.970
You're my mom, right?!
That lady's lying, right?!

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:15.390
Riko...

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:19.600
I don't want a different mom!
I want to stay with you!

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:22.860
I don't want to go anywhere!

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:26.860
I don't want to be away from you either, Riko!

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:28.860
I don't want to give you to anyone!

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:31.700
You don't need to, Masamune-Chan!

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:34.290
You're the one who's raised her!

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:37.960
Who cares about some broad who
suddenly shows up outta nowhere?!

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:40.130
Yeah!

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:44.710
Chou-san... Mariko-san...

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.840
Let's run away again, Mom!

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:49.010
Yeah.

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:54.810
Alright! In that case,
just leave everything to ol' Chou-san!

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:57.100
They're not related?

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.690
Nope.

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:05.110
Apparently, the real mother took the DNA
test report to the Dept. of Child Welfare.

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:07.780
So who is the mother?

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:09.820
It's kept confidential, due to regulations.

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:13.830
I am pulling some strings
inside the department, though.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:17.830
Is she handing the kid over?
I would assume so.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.000
I see.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:24.290
Then I assume I can have that data very soon?

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:28.220
Understood. I'll contact you again.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:29.840
Here you are.

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:32.840
Assemble all management-level members here.

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:35.010
I'm starting up a new project.

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:37.720
A new project?

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:44.110
The "Witchblade Project."

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:50.700
Just more financial reports...

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:52.860
Maybe this one's it...

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:54.700
Knock-knock!

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:58.580
Tozawa-Chan, got a minute?

00:06:58.660 --> 00:06:59.790
Eh?

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.920
Good evening!
Good evening!

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.130
Huh?

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:11.880
No! I hate stupid studying!

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:14.720
Quit that, Maria!

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:17.720
Please don't be so bothersome.

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:20.810
I'm busy with the Cloneblade upgrade.

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:23.520
Who cares?!

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:26.860
Are we neglecting our studies yet again?

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:28.320
Father!

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:35.570
Maria, you possess a very
spectacular intellect, you know.

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:41.460
If you study, you'll become
an even more exceptional person.

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:44.830
Will it make you like me?

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:47.250
Yes, even more than now.

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:49.880
That means you don't really like me now.

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.300
Maria...

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:54.720
Maria, why don't you try coaxing Father?

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:57.140
You do like rewards, right?

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:59.010
Rewards?

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:00.890
A splendid idea.

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:05.150
Tell me anything you would like, Maria.

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:12.110
Mom...

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:17.370
I want my mom!

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:21.330
My mom would definitely like me...

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.670
All right.

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:29.840
Then work hard at your
training and your studies.

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:36.300
Once you can wear the Cloneblade,
I will tell you about your mother.

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:38.350
How does that sound?

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:41.140
You swear?!

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:46.730
It's a promise!

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:51.940
Was it wise to make a promise like that?

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:58.160
Telling her who her mother is
won't pose any real problems.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:01.870
Speaking of which,
I hear her child turned up...

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:02.830
Yes.

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:07.710
Honestly, Reina was so foolish.

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:12.380
A mother, delivering her
own child... How primitive...

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:16.550
But it's somewhat intriguing...

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:26.690
Father.

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:31.520
Might I be able to borrow Nora?

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:34.320
Nora?

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:38.990
You really don't know?!

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:41.030
No idea at all.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:43.290
You just never give up!

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:45.750
We can't tell you what we don't know!

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:46.870
Now listen here!

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:51.380
Hiding information about a child
to be taken into protective custody

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:53.250
is a violation of the Child Protection

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:55.630
Hey, I'm back.

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:57.590
She and Masamune are

00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:59.800
Oh, geez...
Ugh...

00:09:59.890 --> 00:10:01.800
Where did you hide them?!

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:05.140
No idea at all.

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:15.320
Welcome back!

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:20.110
I really stocked up!
Tonight we're having a party!

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:22.120
I'm sorry to bother you like this.

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:23.780
Don't sweat it.

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:28.830
Still, never thought you
girls knew Chou-san, too...

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:30.580
I was surprised too.

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:35.590
He said he'd ask an old friend,
but I didn't know he meant you...

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:37.510
Must be fate.

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:40.050
You can stay here until
things've cooled down.

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:46.010
I won't let anyone on my boat,
not even Child Welfare or the police...

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:47.310
Thank you...

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:51.600
Captain! Does your doggie
still not have a name?

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:54.520
Nah, I'm no good at that kind of stuff.

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:58.570
Then I'll think one up!

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:03.160
I can see why you
can't give up that cutie...

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:04.620
What should we name you?

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:06.330
She...

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:11.120
She means everything to me...

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:20.130
She ran away?

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:23.260
Yes. Ms. Sakurai is looking for her now.

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:25.720
I see. Understood.
Umm...

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:32.520
What is she doing?
She knows it isn't her own child...

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:35.150
Why does she want to stay with her?
lt's incomprehensible...

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:40.740
Bunta! Am I heavy?

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:50.540
Riko.
Yes?

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:53.870
Mom has to stop by the bank real quick.

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:56.710
I'll get you a present, so wait here, okay?

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:00.420
Okay!

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:02.300
Lady?

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:04.550
You mean Reina is her mother?

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:06.850
Yes. Isn't it shocking?

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:10.560
To think the reason she fled
six years ago was to have a child...

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:14.730
I couldn't find out who the father was,

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:17.690
but why would she secretly
give birth all alone?

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:22.440
She was always making observations
of herself as a Neo-Gene.

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:25.860
Not just her body,
but her mentality as well...

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:30.580
It seemed like everything about
herself was a subject of research.

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:35.710
She probably wanted to assess
things on her own, including children.

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:37.580
Oh, speaking of which,

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:40.840
Lady is apparently no longer
compatible with the Witchblade.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:41.760
What?

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:44.670
While Masane-san was captured,

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:47.140
she heard that her compatibility had dropped.

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:50.140
Is this for certain?

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:54.520
I know! Let's write a letter
to Chou-san and the others!

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:57.770
Let's see... "I am doing fine..."

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:00.270
Must be boring, not being able to go anywhere.

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:02.360
No, I'm fine!

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:06.030
Actually, I'm writing a letter
to Chou-san and the others right now!

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:07.820
Oh, that's perfect!

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:11.530
I've sent that dog to
Chou-san's place plenty of times!

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:13.450
He should be able to deliver a letter!

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:16.120
Eh?! You're such a good boy, Bunta!

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:18.830
Oh! So Bunta's the name?

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:20.040
Yes!

00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:26.340
Mom!

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:37.350
I have to constantly be afraid again...
And so does Riko...

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:40.860
Oof...

00:13:40.940 --> 00:13:43.020
She finally left...

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:46.070
Such a big-headed woman,
working for Child Welfare...

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.990
What a laugh!

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:53.790
Oh, Naomi-bou. It's okay now. She's gone.

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:54.830
A dog?!

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:56.120
Huh?

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:04.710
Hey there, dog!
It's good of you to come! Good boy!

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:17.980
Oh, that's right...
Riko starts school next year...

00:14:18.060 --> 00:14:20.850
But as things are now...

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:24.690
Can I help you find something?
Oh, no, that's okay...

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:32.410
He's back!

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:34.120
Welcome back!

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:47.800
Amaha-san, please consider what
will make Rihoko-chan truly happy.

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:54.050
Riko has a real mother...
And yet, I want to be with her...

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:57.430
Does that make me selfish?

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:58.730
But...

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:09.610
She needs the love of her real mother.

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:11.110
Mom...

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:15.740
Help... Mom...

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:28.550
Riko!

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:36.720
What are you planning to do?

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:41.680
I wouldn't know. My job is
simply to take her back with me.

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:44.770
She's my child. Keep your hands off her.

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:48.980
Father is quite displeased with your actions.

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:53.240
Is that so? But I still won't hand her over.

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:57.580
To be honest, I've always
wanted to have at it with you...

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:04.120
To see just how good the supposedly
strongest Neo-Gene really is...

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:14.340
Here I come.

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:26.690
Someone's fighting?!

00:16:58.510 --> 00:17:00.930
Just as I had thought...

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:06.730
But... I'm just getting started!

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:24.120
It's begun.

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:40.720
Goodbye!

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:08.660
Riko!

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:10.120
She's all right.

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.630
Did you save her?

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:17.920
It's only natural to protect one's own child.

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:19.840
Eh?!

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:21.590
You're Riko's...

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:23.850
Why did you run off with her?

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:27.680
Umm... I...

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:30.270
You aren't her mother.

00:18:30.350 --> 00:18:33.770
Which is why you didn't care
about placing her in danger.

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:35.860
What?! Didn't care?!

00:18:35.940 --> 00:18:39.700
Even just the other day,
she fainted in town because of a cold.

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:45.740
So you were the one who helped her then?

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:51.290
I only did what a mother would do.

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:53.710
What were you doing?

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:57.000
I was...

00:18:57.090 --> 00:19:00.930
Mom... Mom...

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:03.760
Mom!

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:10.770
Mom?

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:15.900
Riko...

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:24.950
She's your real mom.

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:26.120
Eh?

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:30.500
Live with her from now on.

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:34.790
Eh?! How come?! No!
We decided to stay together!

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:40.130
Come on, Mom! Let's run away!
I only want to be with you! Let's go!

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:43.930
I changed my mind.

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:49.770
We're not family anymore,
so I don't wanna take care of you.

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:53.980
It'll be much easier living alone,
I can use money freely,

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:56.690
and I can have all the fun I want.

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:01.110
I'm tired of all this.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:03.490
Hey! What are you ?!

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:06.870
Go.
Hey!

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:10.540
Riko-Chan...
Oh, I see...

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:14.330
Your mom is just
We can't be together...

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:19.340
We can't be together, can we?

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:25.430
Because you're not my real mom...

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:28.930
That's why...
Take her now.

00:20:29.010 --> 00:20:30.560
Hurry!

00:20:36.730 --> 00:20:38.730
Are you all set?

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:20.310
Riko...

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:26.150
If I'm with her, Mom can't be free...

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:28.910
We can't be together, can we?

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:35.120
Because this person is my mom...

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:39.540
My real mom...

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:54.740
I turn around half-asleep as my hits the right side of my cheek

00:21:54.740 --> 00:22:02.990
Your voice was there, and the air was warm

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:11.260
Your right hand grazes my left shoulder

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.730
But why don't you hold on tight?

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:28.500
In order to change yesterday's wish tomorrow,

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:35.690
I need to grow stronger myself

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:44.840
Even now, I am breathing in your scent, ...

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:53.510
and jumping over to your side. Give me your love.

00:22:55.180 --> 00:23:02.990
Extend your hands. Reach them out to me.

00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:09.540
I'm so happy
